  "description": "Yang So-Yeon, the top student in the liberal arts department who always made mistakes on mock exams and failed to get a perfect score, has been annoyed by Kim Jun-Su, the top student in the science department who has been getting perfect scores on mock exams since her first year. On the long-awaited first mock exam of her third year of high school, So-Yeon becomes anxious and approaches Jun-Su...\n\nWill an unexpected meeting begin?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
